<h1>Privacy Policy for Tic Nuts</h1>

<p class="date"><strong>Effective Date:</strong> September 11, 2026</p>

<p>
    Tic Nuts ("we", "our", or "the App") respects your privacy.
    This Privacy Policy explains how information is handled when
    you use the Tic Nuts mobile application.
</p>

<h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>

<p>
    Tic Nuts does not require you to provide personal information
    such as:
</p>

<ul>
    <li>Your name</li>
    <li>Your age</li>
    <li>Your gender</li>
    <li>Your location</li>
    <li>Your phone number</li>
    <li>Your email address</li>
    <li>Your personal photographs</li>
    <li>Your contacts</li>
    <li>Your address</li>
</ul>

<p>
    You can use the main features of Tic Nuts without creating
    a personal profile or providing identifying information.
</p>

<h2>2. Information You Enter</h2>

<p>
    Tic Nuts may allow you to enter text when using certain
    prompts or AI-powered features.
</p>

<p>
    Please avoid entering sensitive or highly personal information
    that you do not want to be processed by third-party services.
</p>

<h2>3. Device and Technical Information</h2>

<p>
    Tic Nuts does not intentionally collect personal information
    for the purpose of identifying you.
</p>

<p>
    However, third-party services integrated into the App may
    automatically collect limited technical or usage information,
    such as device information, application activity, crash
    information, or diagnostic information, depending on which
    services are enabled.
</p>

<h2>4. Third-Party Services</h2>

<p>
    Tic Nuts may use third-party services to provide, maintain,
    analyze, or improve the App.
</p>

<p>These services may include:</p>

<ul>
    <li>Google Firebase</li>
    <li>Google Analytics for Firebase</li>
    <li>Firebase Crashlytics</li>
    <li>Google AdMob</li>
    <li>AI service providers</li>
</ul>

<p>
    Third-party services may process information according to
    their own privacy policies and terms.
</p>

<h2>5. Advertising</h2>

<p>
    If advertising is enabled in Tic Nuts, advertisements may
    be provided by third-party advertising providers such as
    Google AdMob.
</p>

<h2>6. Data Storage</h2>

<p>
    Tic Nuts does not require you to create an account to use
    its basic functionality.
</p>

<p>
    Information stored locally by the App, if any, may remain
    on your device and can generally be removed by deleting
    the App or clearing its application data.
</p>

<h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>

<p>
    Tic Nuts is not specifically designed to collect personal
    information from children. We do not knowingly collect
    personal information from children through the App.
</p>

<h2>8. Data Security</h2>

<p>
    We take reasonable measures to protect information processed
    through the App. However, no method of electronic transmission
    or storage can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
</p>

<h2>9. Your Choices</h2>

<p>
    You can choose not to provide personal information through
    the App. You may also stop using the App and remove locally
    stored App data by uninstalling the App or clearing its data.
</p>

<h2>10. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>

<p>
    We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time as
    Tic Nuts evolves or as legal and technical requirements change.
</p>

<p>
    Any updated version will be made available at the same location
    as this Privacy Policy, with a revised effective date.
</p>

<h2>11. Contact</h2>

<p>
    If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or the privacy
    practices of Tic Nuts, you can contact us at:
</p>

<p>
    <strong>Email:</strong> YOUR_EMAIL@example.com
</p>

<p><strong>Tic Nuts</strong></p>
